WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:31.500
In verse 16.23,

2
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.916
Lord Krishna emphasises

3
00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:36.791
that connecting life to the guidance of scripture

4
00:00:36.791 --> 00:00:38.166
is essential.

5
00:00:38.166 --> 00:00:40.958
In this verse He gives a warning –

6
00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:42.791
when someone acts wilfully,

7
00:00:42.791 --> 00:00:44.916
ignoring scripture,

8
00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:46.416
which is the sacred foundation

9
00:00:46.416 --> 00:00:48.958
for elevating human consciousness,

10
00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:52.041
the consequences are serious.

11
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.583
Lord Krishna says –

12
00:00:58.583 --> 00:01:00.583
when a person acts shastravidhim

13
00:01:00.583 --> 00:01:02.250
utsrijya,

14
00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:05.416
giving up the methods of scripture,

15
00:01:05.416 --> 00:01:09.125
and moves only by their own wilful desires –

16
00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:12.583
kamakaratah – they lose the true

17
00:01:12.583 --> 00:01:15.375
purposes of life.

18
00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:18.625
Shastravidhim utsrijya means

19
00:01:18.625 --> 00:01:22.166
ignoring the guidance of scripture.

20
00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:25.375
These are not ordinary optional rules,

21
00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:27.458
but divine directions given

22
00:01:27.458 --> 00:01:29.375
for our elevation.

23
00:01:29.375 --> 00:01:31.833
When they are disregarded,

24
00:01:31.833 --> 00:01:35.625
the mind naturally falls under
the sway of craving, greed,

25
00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:39.000
and anger like impulses,

26
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.708
and discernment is covered over.

27
00:01:41.708 --> 00:01:43.750
So what is the result?

28
00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:48.500
‘Na sa siddhim avapnoti, na sukham,
na param gatim’ –

29
00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:50.208
such a person attains neither self-

30
00:01:50.208 --> 00:01:52.583
purification, siddhi,

31
00:01:52.583 --> 00:01:55.625
nor true joy, sukham, nor

32
00:01:55.625 --> 00:01:59.041
the supreme state, param gatim.

33
00:01:59.041 --> 00:02:02.416
Scripture gives life a foundation and a structure.

34
00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:06.458
Without it, life becomes only a
chain of impulses,

35
00:02:06.458 --> 00:02:09.000
where a person abandons the substance

36
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:12.291
and chases only the shadow of desire,

37
00:02:12.291 --> 00:02:15.375
with no steady support.

38
00:02:15.375 --> 00:02:17.833
If even worldly success

39
00:02:17.833 --> 00:02:20.375
requires discipline,

40
00:02:20.375 --> 00:02:21.583
then consider

41
00:02:21.583 --> 00:02:25.250
how much more essential it is in spiritual life.

42
00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.958
The message of this verse is clear.

43
00:02:27.958 --> 00:02:30.625
Give up living by whim

44
00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:33.833
and remain centred in the direction of scripture.

45
00:02:33.833 --> 00:02:36.291
This is the path that leads to lasting peace

46
00:02:36.291 --> 00:02:40.083
and life's supreme purpose.

47
00:02:44.666 --> 00:02:47.625
Often this happens –

48
00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:51.000
you hear a high truth,

49
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:55.291
but if it does not align with your desires,

50
00:02:55.291 --> 00:02:57.958
you set it aside.

51
00:02:57.958 --> 00:02:59.208
You say –

52
00:02:59.208 --> 00:03:02.333
‘No, no, this feels right to me.’

53
00:03:02.333 --> 00:03:03.958
And treating that momentary feeling

54
00:03:03.958 --> 00:03:08.000
as truth, you proceed by it.

55
00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:13.000
This is the situation where kamah, lust,

56
00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:16.541
itself becomes your compass.

57
00:03:16.541 --> 00:03:20.958
And slowly you stop moving toward Me,

58
00:03:20.958 --> 00:03:23.875
and begin going round and round

59
00:03:23.875 --> 00:03:27.666
your own desires.

60
00:03:27.666 --> 00:03:29.666
This is why I have said –

61
00:03:29.666 --> 00:03:32.666
one who ignores scripture

62
00:03:32.666 --> 00:03:37.250
and acts only on impulse attains
neither self-purification, 

63
00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.500
siddhi,

64
00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:42.125
nor true joy, nor the supreme state.

65
00:03:42.125 --> 00:03:43.875
If you keep

66
00:03:43.875 --> 00:03:45.958
rejecting wisdom

67
00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:51.041
because it does not satisfy your present mood,

68
00:03:51.041 --> 00:03:52.000
you will get neither

69
00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.500
deep joy, nor

70
00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:59.875
inner growth, nor the supreme goal of life.

71
00:03:59.875 --> 00:04:03.166
True freedom does not mean

72
00:04:03.166 --> 00:04:06.875
doing whatever you want.

73
00:04:06.875 --> 00:04:10.416
Freedom means knowing

74
00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:13.375
which desires

75
00:04:13.375 --> 00:04:16.416
are truly worth pursuing.

76
00:04:16.416 --> 00:04:21.750
Not every shining thing is gold.

77
00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:24.583
Not every lake seen in the distance

78
00:04:24.583 --> 00:04:28.958
in a desert holds real water.

79
00:04:28.958 --> 00:04:32.000
Before taking any path,

80
00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.625
it is always wiser to know

81
00:04:33.625 --> 00:04:37.666
the truth, free from illusion.

82
00:04:37.666 --> 00:04:41.750
Your heart may be sincere,

83
00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:46.916
but sincerity needs direction.

84
00:04:46.916 --> 00:04:49.541
Make Me your direction.

85
00:04:49.541 --> 00:04:53.000
Do not chase only the shine.

86
00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.666
Walk the path

87
00:04:54.666 --> 00:04:58.958
that truly takes you somewhere.

88
00:04:58.958 --> 00:05:00.916
That is,

89
00:05:00.916 --> 00:05:03.125
toward Me.

90
00:05:03.125 --> 00:05:07.291
That is where your real joy begins.

91
00:05:12.083 --> 00:05:14.791
In every generation new ideas come

92
00:05:14.791 --> 00:05:17.125
and go.

93
00:05:17.125 --> 00:05:20.333
But think – which ideas

94
00:05:20.333 --> 00:05:23.375
is your family taking guidance from?

95
00:05:23.375 --> 00:05:26.708
Are they the passing opinions of today?

96
00:05:26.708 --> 00:05:30.375
The trends currently running in the world?

97
00:05:30.375 --> 00:05:33.375
Or the timeless principles

98
00:05:33.375 --> 00:05:37.083
whose roots are grounded in dharma?

99
00:05:37.083 --> 00:05:40.500
I have said clearly – those who give up

100
00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:44.375
shastravidhi and act only on
the mind's impulses,

101
00:05:44.375 --> 00:05:49.458
or make the crowd's tendencies their path,

102
00:05:49.458 --> 00:05:52.791
lose their way.

103
00:05:52.791 --> 00:05:55.791
They may get momentary excitement,

104
00:05:55.791 --> 00:05:59.791
but not true joy, sukham, not lasting progress,

105
00:05:59.791 --> 00:06:03.583
siddhi, and not life's supreme
attainment, param gatim.

106
00:06:03.583 --> 00:06:06.083
When family decisions

107
00:06:06.083 --> 00:06:08.333
are based only on

108
00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:11.750
‘what feels good right now’, rather than on

109
00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:15.541
‘what is right in the long run’,

110
00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:18.375
the foundation weakens.

111
00:06:18.375 --> 00:06:22.416
Values are neglected, relationships

112
00:06:22.416 --> 00:06:25.291
come under strain, and finally

113
00:06:25.291 --> 00:06:28.708
the home becomes merely a building,
not a shelter.

114
00:06:28.708 --> 00:06:33.500
But when your choices are connected
not only to feelings,

115
00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:36.458
but to truth,

116
00:06:36.458 --> 00:06:39.291
then you build a home

117
00:06:39.291 --> 00:06:42.291
that can withstand even storms.

118
00:06:42.291 --> 00:06:43.958
Trends keep changing,

119
00:06:43.958 --> 00:06:47.000
but truth never changes.

120
00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.583
So decide –

121
00:06:49.583 --> 00:06:54.833
on which foundation do you
want to build your life?

122
00:06:54.833 --> 00:06:55.875
On the shifting sand

123
00:06:55.875 --> 00:07:00.083
that flows with the current of time,

124
00:07:00.083 --> 00:07:02.083
or on the firm rock

125
00:07:02.083 --> 00:07:03.458
of truth?

126
00:07:08.208 --> 00:07:12.291
Independent thinking is admirable.

127
00:07:12.291 --> 00:07:15.166
Genuinely necessary too.

128
00:07:15.166 --> 00:07:19.500
But if your independence means

129
00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:23.500
ignoring time-tested guidance

130
00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:26.791
and the experience of those

131
00:07:26.791 --> 00:07:30.458
who have walked this path before,

132
00:07:30.458 --> 00:07:33.750
that is not innovation,

133
00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:36.458
but hidden arrogance.

134
00:07:36.458 --> 00:07:42.000
I have said, those who ignore scripture

135
00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.291
and act under the sway of desire,

136
00:07:45.291 --> 00:07:49.583
attain neither self-purification, siddhi,

137
00:07:49.583 --> 00:07:53.750
nor peace, nor the supreme attainment.

138
00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:58.083
This applies to your profession too.

139
00:07:58.083 --> 00:08:00.833
You may convince yourself

140
00:08:00.833 --> 00:08:03.750
that your decisions are logical.

141
00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.416
But pause and ask –

142
00:08:06.416 --> 00:08:11.000
are they truly made from clarity,

143
00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:12.166
or is there

144
00:08:12.166 --> 00:08:16.875
a hidden craving behind them?

145
00:08:16.875 --> 00:08:18.083
Some people

146
00:08:18.083 --> 00:08:20.875
pass an exam through dishonesty,

147
00:08:20.875 --> 00:08:24.000
but without real knowledge,

148
00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:27.541
they cannot sustain it later.

149
00:08:27.541 --> 00:08:31.125
Success gained through deceit is short-lived.

150
00:08:31.125 --> 00:08:33.916
What endures is always

151
00:08:33.916 --> 00:08:38.000
what is built on truth and genuine knowledge.

152
00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:41.708
When your actions are driven by impulse

153
00:08:41.708 --> 00:08:44.666
and not anchored in principles,

154
00:08:44.666 --> 00:08:48.208
they may bring momentary thrill,

155
00:08:48.208 --> 00:08:52.125
but never lasting respect

156
00:08:52.125 --> 00:08:53.750
or influence.

157
00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:57.041
Then your career may have a bright

158
00:08:57.041 --> 00:09:00.875
beginning, but

159
00:09:00.875 --> 00:09:04.500
it becomes a series of hollow endings.

160
00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:08.083
This is not about suppressing originality, but

161
00:09:08.083 --> 00:09:12.291
about joining it with wisdom.

162
00:09:12.291 --> 00:09:13.958
What is proven –

163
00:09:13.958 --> 00:09:16.916
build on those principles,

164
00:09:16.916 --> 00:09:19.833
refine them with fresh vision,

165
00:09:19.833 --> 00:09:25.833
and let your ambition be driven by a purpose,

166
00:09:25.833 --> 00:09:27.625
not by ego.

167
00:09:27.625 --> 00:09:32.291
Only then does success become
meaningful and lasting.
